    "identifier": "kashu-demonic-instrument-blessed-sonnet",
    "description": "<p>You play a song through your Shinobi Instrument at the benefit of your allies. This music blesses their ears and mentally refreshes them. Remove 1 rank of any Mental or Sensory condition and before the end of their next turns, they add a d4 to one non-d20 based roll they make, adding the d4 to the result.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the number of creatures you can target by +1.</p>",
